Title: "Exists Unique"
Id: "a78b325f-4ce5-474c-bfe5-602d963ff4f5"

Text: "`existsUnique:` has the same surface shape as `exists:` but records unique-existence intent.

```mlg-fragment
existsUnique: x is \real
```

```mlg-fragment
existsUnique: y \"in\" B
suchThat: f(x) = y
```

`suchThat:` is optional. Introduced symbols are available in the `suchThat:` section when it is present."
Id: "5fbf742c-d943-4b90-8fb3-7f9fa775275c"
